Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Spell Blast
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mind Twist
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
